WEBVTT

00:31.538 --> 00:34.439
Nothing but loud on a lonely road

00:37.941 --> 00:41.063
Just trying to get back to you I'm

00:45.665 --> 00:51.828
carrying this heavy load They're telling me

00:51.928 --> 00:53.869
what I have to do

00:57.969 --> 01:01.431
The lights are bright, the stage is cold They're

01:01.471 --> 01:06.094
trying to fit me in their mold I see your face

01:06.174 --> 01:08.135
across the black I

01:11.498 --> 01:16.941
know that we can find our way back We're worlds

01:17.021 --> 01:21.564
apart, but our hearts beat the same

01:25.356 --> 01:31.138
I can hear you call my name Through the distance,

01:31.678 --> 01:36.260
through the static and the dark We're finding a

01:36.300 --> 01:43.142
way back to the start Even when we're worlds

01:43.162 --> 01:43.602
apart

01:57.555 --> 02:01.004
They want the loudest. They want the engine. A

02:01.104 --> 02:03.851
different version for a different show. But

02:04.433 --> 02:06.779
we're the ones who'll be hearing it.

02:11.092 --> 02:16.474
We've got a fire they'll never know. We're

02:16.534 --> 02:24.677
worlds apart, but our hearts beat the same.

02:25.377 --> 02:30.419
I can hear you call my name. Through the

02:30.479 --> 02:34.820
distance, through the static and the dark,

02:35.421 --> 02:41.918
we're finding a way back to the start. Even when

02:41.938 --> 02:43.499
we're worlds apart

02:47.661 --> 02:47.901
And

02:56.586 --> 03:03.990
when the mountains fall And when the oceans rise

03:05.290 --> 03:14.360
I'll find you I'll find you We're worlds apart,

03:15.260 --> 03:18.001
but our hearts beat the same I

03:22.123 --> 03:27.825
can hear you call my name Through the distance,

03:28.346 --> 03:32.808
through the static and the dark We're finding

03:32.868 --> 03:39.851
our way back to the start Even when we're worlds

03:40.051 --> 03:47.631
apart Words of love, they fail

